  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1706134431_804496_a11179cb9c9cd90c4bd092e617fcb1da.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Traditional Treats produced locally sourced and made pet treats that are raw, single ingredient, grain free, and freeze dried! We offer a truly back to basics approach to pet health where simple ingredients really do matter. Our dog and cat treats are great for training, topping, and treating and will always remain simple, healthy, and tasty. Lets get back to basics together</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>We start with locally sourced meat from local Minnesota butchers, and then process, freeze-dry, package, and ship all from Minnesota. Our first product is Beef Liver, and is a great introduction to our treats for your dog or cat with a food that is grain free, raw, and packed with nutrients. Can be used for training, mixed on top of their food, or given as a treat anytime.&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The pet food market has been saturated with expensive, complicated, and downright unhealthy food for a long time. Traditional Treats uses the benefits of freeze-drying to offer a shelf stable solution to this problem. The end result is a great pet food that doesnt need to mimic the real thing, it is the real thing.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Will work with each affiliate per their needs, skills, and style of marketing. Will provide a prepayment per project and a commision percentage based on a tier system up to 10%.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Reach out to find out more on how we can work together!</p>\r\n</div>",
